name: Hologram — deck-growth X-mult
author: corpus
description: >-
  Hologram gains X0.25 Mult every time a playing card is added to the deck. First-shop
  scaling: pair with DNA, Marble Joker, and Certificate to keep adding cards.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: Hologram
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: DNA
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: MarbleJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Certificate
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
